# Milestone 9 loopback lockstep on a TX: hosts a game on Joust (second map
# in the list) with the second copy of the game in the app joining, and
# drives about. Debug build with EXTRA="-DLOOPBACK_TEST -DAUTOQUIT_SECONDS=42"
# and LOOPBACK_DROP_AT=12 or LOOPBACK_DESYNC_AT=700 to see a bot take over or
# the game stop out of step. Install Joust.pdb (tools/map2pdb.py) with the
# app. Times are ms after launch and settle.
